Created by Weiwei Huang (@beetz12).

This is a hand-authored, printing-press-compatible CLI submitted to the CLI
Printing Press Library (https://github.com/mvanhorn/printing-press-library). It
follows the library's conventions (cobra subcommands, agent-native JSON output,
a doctor command, the .printing-press.json manifest, and an editable embedded
data registry), but it wraps no HTTP API: it is a data-driven guided assistant
over an embedded, editable provider registry.

